{"c":[{"id":"c6064da85f9f18d6","sum":"Build gotchas (HI2): a double hyphen in an Info.plist XML comment refuses every build-app.sh mode (the gate parses it); h11/h13/h14 harness build.sh exports from a hardcoded worktree on v2/host and cp -cR turns a symlinked node_modules into a dangling link.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261008T080815Z-40413337304fea62","text":"The privacy gate parses apps/caret/Bundle/Info.plist as XML, so a double hyphen inside an XML comment refuses every build-app.sh mode (v2/onboard-privacy ccff2558 rewords it; HI2).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261008T080815Z-5040e69897a0bba9","text":"VM harness build.sh (h11/h13/h14) exports from a hardcoded worktree W, requires the commit on v2/host, and clones W's node_modules with cp -cR, which copies a symlinked node_modules as a dangling link (HI2).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"84a4af324deddcaf","sum":"VS1: Disclosure composes at most 8 ways, so a request rebuilt after the verifier minted its parts as plan text needs 'plan' in its shape slot. Ask value options read 'Proposed value: \"…\". Source: …'; stand-ins match them with builders.ts optionIs.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261008T103634Z-c66a1e426ad50081","text":"VS1: Disclosure composes at most MAX_WAYS (8) ways; past that a text carries every reason of its parts, so a request rebuilt after the verifier minted its parts as plan text needs 'plan' in its shape slot.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261008T103634Z-ffaa923aad520f1c","text":"VS1: an Ask's value options state exact outputs ('Proposed value: \"…\". Source: …'); test stand-ins match them with test/builders.ts optionIs, while a fill on focus keeps its quoted-candidate criteria.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
